主要终点:
Change in Perfusion-Metabolism Abnormality Burden in the Affected Hemisphere From Baseline to 1 Month After Recanalization (ΔPMB)

The cerebral perfusion-metabolism coupling index will be derived from spatially corresponding cerebral perfusion and PET-based metabolic measurements within prespecified regions of interest in the affected MCA territory. The exact coupling metric, its calculation, normalization, and interpretation will be defined in the prespecified imaging analysis protocol. The primary measure will be the within-participant change in this index between baseline and the specified follow-up visit.

